  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Eleanor Rigby** (1 other source): Eleanor Rigby flowed directly into I Want You, which the setlist doesn't list [1]\n- **Tuesday Night Squad** (1 other source): Tuesday Night Squad was played as the encore, closing the show after Do It Again [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Leave Me Alone**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Bobby Bird**: back after 59 archived shows (1086 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Revolution**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **In My Life**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **The Thrill Is Gone**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2011-08-07.soulive2011-08-07.soulive2011-08-07** (recommended): soundboard; 14 songs; 119 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2011-08-07.soulive2011-08-07.soulive2011-08-07**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G; source: SBD> Digi Mod Edirol UA5> Zoom H2 [1]. Also: Recording was patched with a soundboard source, with John and Joel supplying the patch [1]",
